    "status": "blocked",
    "blockers": [
      "The tracked explicit-cell launcher and task-specific runtime require formal runtime verification on the target server before execution.",
      "Every reused Source ledger must be tracked and its selected metric artifact must be content-bound by the corresponding formal run manifest; the legacy R2R val_seen ledger requires reauthentication.",
      "ETPNav and BEVBert require authenticated matched Source manifests on native R2R-CE v1.2 for both validation splits; unified-v1.3 Source evidence is forbidden.",
      "The three pinned IDEA source-training-statistics artifacts are intentionally untracked runtime inputs and must be present and SHA256-verified on the target server.",
      "The FeedTTA-LLM hidden-test transfer requires a separate headless MatterSim build, licensed raw Matterport RGB, and a same-commit PRECHECK.json whose complete artifact graph is reauthenticated before launch."
    ],
    "rule": "Planning and validation are allowed. No campaign phase may launch until every applicable blocker is cleared in a successor implementation review without changing this scientific contract."
  },
  "purpose": {
    "phase": "targeted_gap_development_then_frozen_evaluation",
    "hypothesis": "Small, model-specific grids around the tracked consistency-search anchors can fill the sixteen declared unpopulated VLN model-method cells without selecting on val_seen, while preserving task-native action semantics and supervision labels.",
    "decision": "Select exactly one configuration per cell on canonical val_unseen seed 0, freeze all sixteen winners together, and evaluate those winners once on canonical val_seen seed 0."
  },
